# Gluestack / React Native / Web

Read `AGENTS.md` for full context. Critical rules:

## Web DOM — always strip RN props

In `*.web.tsx`, never spread raw props onto `div`/`span`:

```tsx
// ✅
<div {...webDomProps(props)} className={boxStyle({ class: className })} />

// ❌
<div {...props} />
```

Import from `@/components/ui/web-dom-props`.

## No style arrays on web

```tsx
// ❌ crashes: CSSStyleDeclaration indexed property
<View style={[a, b]} />

// ✅
<Box className="p-4" />
```

## FlatList empty states

Render empty UI **outside** FlatList (early return), not via `ListEmptyComponent={<Center/>}`.

## Styling

- Use `className` + Gluestack `tva()` — not inline `style`
- Use `Box`/`VStack`/`HStack`/`Center` from `@/components/ui/`
- Theme tokens: `components/ui/gluestack-ui-provider/config.ts`
